# =============================================================================
# Savage Sun Rising - combined .NET (legacy DarkSun.*) + Node/Next.js (apps/web)
# Secrets never go in git: use environment variables, .env (ignored) or
# `dotnet user-secrets`. See SECURITY.md.
# =============================================================================

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Secrets & local environment ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
secrets/
.secrets/
secrets.json
**/.user-secrets/
.aws/
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
# Local-only ASP.NET config (tracked appsettings.json / appsettings.Development.json hold no secrets)
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Staging.json
# launchSettings.json has held credentials in the past - keep it local
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
# ASP.NET Core Data Protection key ring (cookie/antiforgery encryption keys)
**/DataProtection-Keys/

# --- .NET build output ---
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
publish/
*.user
*.suo
*.log
TestResults/

# --- Node / Next.js / Prisma ---
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Working files that must never be committed ---
_to_delete/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
